{"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.057889672940568127,"w":0.10391382217407226,"c":1,"x":0.084721289493390403,"h":0.016488095944873771},{"y":0.10583522290339942,"x":0.084710685322109361,"w":0.084903888702392585,"t":"PART 4","h":0.015073739539667619,"c":1},{"y":0.13505948226196529,"w":0.62975779215494787,"x":0.086505186880036958,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"t":"For my presentation today I'm going to talk about some of the issues facing the cruise ship"},{"c":1,"t":"industry and then some ways these can be addressed. The cruise ship industry has partly","y":0.15115465350845969,"w":0.61764704386393232,"x":0.08304499009301404,"h":0.016095171448565426},{"w":0.59861592610677083,"h":0.013081395100512871,"y":0.16715116291270826,"t":"been responsible for the effects of overtourism in recent decades. Overtourism occurs","c":1,"x":0.0865051856376544},{"t":"in places where excessive numbers of tourists cause significant problems. Pollution, for","y":0.18159552160023962,"x":0.083044975656879724,"w":0.60553634643554688,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1},{"x":0.084775079381142621,"h":0.016095171448565426,"t":"example, is among the greatest threats to many popular tourist destinations.","y":0.19909027262024526,"w":0.53633219401041676,"c":1},{"y":0.22238372100561943,"x":0.084775097680464789,"t":"Of course, for many places it's a difficult balance to achieve. They want to promote their city","c":1,"w":0.64186848958333342,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"t":"or island as a desirable tourist destination, but at the same time, are unable to cope with","y":0.23827851622547891,"w":0.61764704386393232,"c":1,"x":0.084775093900477994},{"x":0.084775096449916376,"h":0.014708814627645284,"y":0.25436046488138064,"w":0.61072662353515628,"c":1,"t":"thousands of cruise ship passengers on a daily basis. The trouble is, excessive tourism is"},{"h":0.017541625100970681,"t":"destroying the beauty spots and places of interest that people come to visit. Several cities,","x":0.08472900036159127,"w":0.63159062703450519,"c":1,"y":0.26881727793851129},{"t":"such as Barcelona, have responded by imposing a tax which all visitors to the city from","y":0.28430472061716761,"c":1,"x":0.08298972408777866,"w":0.60218597412109376,"h":0.018455093602687045},{"t":"cruise ships have to pay. But as it's only a couple of euros, many green campaigners think it","y":0.300872092740049,"h":0.017532386005633893,"w":0.63494812011718749,"x":0.08477507484948972,"c":1},{"x":0.084775088627552286,"w":0.3615916951497396,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"won't deter enough people to make any difference.","y":0.31686046506064403,"c":1},{"t":"Bruges is another city which became impossible to navigate at times because of the huge","c":1,"y":0.34009797030925115,"x":0.084775086993488416,"w":0.62283737182617183,"h":0.016095171448565426},{"y":0.35755813965675898,"t":"numbers of cruise passengers arriving on day trips from the port of Zeebrugge. The city was","w":0.64013839721679688,"c":1,"x":0.086505195768764143,"h":0.01308139510051276},{"c":1,"x":0.084720238630794517,"h":0.019191065228344018,"w":0.63506479899088542,"t":"becoming like a 'theme park', with shops only catering for tourists, selling chocolate, which","y":0.37113948552334852},{"c":1,"x":0.084775087560600801,"y":0.38943317032597813,"h":0.016095171448565315,"w":0.60034601847330737,"t":"Belgium is famous for, and other souvenirs. The local council took action to limit cruise"},{"t":"passengers to a more manageable level.","x":0.086364503538648163,"h":0.015912925554706581,"c":1,"y":0.40482538573053706,"w":0.28222231547037763},{"y":0.42862141330989501,"t":"Dubrovnik had to limit the numbers of cruise ships after it became extremely popular as a","h":0.013296011196641033,"c":1,"w":0.62110727945963529,"x":0.086505183715403333},{"x":0.084775091970069286,"y":0.44471658522407376,"w":0.64013839721679688,"h":0.01469559132260323,"t":"cruise ship destination when it featured in a hugely successful TV series. What it does now is","c":1},{"w":0.63840830485026046,"c":1,"x":0.084775086259261723,"t":"control the timing of all cruise ship entries to the city's port. However, many people feel this","y":0.45930232529868897,"h":0.017604602309187589},{"t":"measure does not go far enough.","y":0.47674418580597622,"x":0.086505186779375923,"w":0.23356402079264327,"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"c":1,"y":0.52169349168543722,"t":"Cruise ships may be unpopular in some of their destinations but they also have an image","x":0.086505186270613113,"w":0.61418685913085935,"h":0.014695591322603119},{"c":1,"t":"problem. They've always been perceived as a safe holiday for the elderly, with not much","x":0.084733171874448537,"y":0.53640266137866499,"w":0.6142750549316407,"h":0.017708290532554627},{"c":1,"x":0.086460219303235983,"y":0.55211559840265045,"w":0.6038970947265625,"h":0.017663110128393389,"t":"on offer for families or young couples. A recent survey showed that cost is also a major"},{"t":"factor in putting younger groups off going on a cruise. But what they don't realise is that","h":0.016126702764469703,"w":0.61937718709309897,"x":0.083044970378542526,"c":1,"y":0.56962911110911352},{"c":1,"t":"compared to other types of package holidays, cruises can actually be good value, as all","w":0.60726643880208331,"x":0.084775085020365376,"h":0.016095171448565426,"y":0.58572428271263954},{"w":0.62975779215494787,"t":"activities and drinks are often included. And another perception is that cruises have lots of","x":0.084775083080339847,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"y":0.60174418581158251},{"h":0.014702711512443511,"y":0.61756473057858274,"c":1,"x":0.086505186260481301,"t":"rules about what to wear and how to behave. But these days, most cruises are no longer","w":0.61418685913085935},{"w":0.23702423095703123,"t":"very formal and behind the times.","c":1,"y":0.63365990217717816,"x":0.084775081665930396,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"x":0.084775088787110209,"y":0.65697674395106642,"w":0.63148788452148441,"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"So what solutions are there for cruise lines to overcome some of these problems? How can"},{"x":0.086505186883735277,"w":0.62975779215494798,"y":0.67284814578658725,"t":"they appeal to younger customers? Well one selling point is that cruise ships are becoming","c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"y":0.68894331703305312,"c":1,"x":0.084775074809243733,"w":0.63494812011718749,"t":"more sustainable. New ships are built with hybrid engines with large batteries which means","h":0.016095171448565426},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"x":0.086505201754038738,"t":"ships do not have to keep their engines running while docked.","y":0.70494186022929661,"w":0.43425603230794263},{"w":0.61591695149739578,"x":0.084775088177391211,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"y":0.72813156063817841,"t":"Cruise lines are also designing ships specially for those in the age range of 21 to 45. The"},{"x":0.084775079283892205,"c":1,"h":0.01613585710358667,"y":0.74418604658674659,"t":"décor in these feels contemporary and there are a range of activities on board that you","w":0.60553634643554688},{"x":0.086505185653230871,"w":0.59861592610677083,"c":1,"y":0.76017441836964483,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"wouldn't find on a more traditional cruise. There's even a boxing ring on one ship, and"},{"t":"most offer diving expeditions. But there's also a huge focus on well-being with a variety of","h":0.016095171448565426,"x":0.084775083081747193,"y":0.77606717975053829,"w":0.62975779215494787,"c":1},{"y":0.78966956444334035,"w":0.18561300913492837,"x":0.086303421278589004,"t":"sessions of different kinds.","h":0.017128783560366401,"c":1},{"y":0.81525542304484666,"x":0.086505183100270291,"w":0.60553634643554688,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"t":"Food is always a very important part of any cruise and cruise ships have had to radically"},{"w":0.57279078165690112,"x":0.086447471239359377,"c":1,"h":0.017167007948152735,"t":"update their menus to suit the tastes of their younger customers. Vegan dishes are","y":0.82997433784371044},{"w":0.60034601847330737,"c":1,"x":0.086505191368882628,"t":"standard, for example. The restaurants on board have also gone paperless with menus","h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.84738372069487844},{"y":0.8630387763873929,"t":"available on screen.","w":0.13873905181884769,"h":0.013512903030641121,"x":0.086365090561767277,"c":1},{"t":"Unlike older generations who went on cruises largely to get away from everything, younger","x":0.086456087160640419,"y":0.88522186957529059,"h":0.017604981376375672,"c":1,"w":0.6350388590494791},{"y":0.90261627913543729,"w":0.62456746419270837,"t":"people expect to be able to keep in touch with friends and family. Many people going on","x":0.084775091664168509,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1},{"h":0.016118565499991133,"c":1,"w":0.61764704386393232,"y":0.9184744576721191,"x":0.084775094038476856,"t":"longer cruises also spend time working, so companies have to guarantee wifi that can be"},{"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"w":0.16608996073404947,"t":"relied upon at all times.","x":0.084775088723775885,"y":0.93456962895905416},{"y":0.95639534892289679,"t":"106","x":0.086505189862334575,"w":0.031141869227091473,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1},{"x":0.74913494860436458,"t":"Q31","w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"y":0.18313953496940838},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395100512871,"t":"Q32","x":0.74913494860977115,"y":0.28488372101351533,"w":0.032871971130371103},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"Q33","y":0.37499999978145704,"c":1,"h":0.011627907349230693,"x":0.74913494860917051},{"c":1,"h":0.011627907349230693,"x":0.74913494860917051,"t":"Q34","y":0.46220930210703837,"w":0.032871971130371103},{"x":0.74913494884657916,"y":0.55377906976079005,"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"Q35","c":1,"h":0.013081395100512871},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"t":"Q36","y":0.6177325582228177,"x":0.74913494860977115},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"w":0.034602076212565058,"c":1,"t":"Q37","y":0.77761627915759246,"x":0.7491349479663818},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"Q38","y":0.83284883699075929,"x":0.74913494860917051,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1},{"x":0.747404844165242,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"y":0.92005813962057126,"w":0.034602076212565058,"t":"Q39"}],"h":2857}